on in total savings capital. This is equivalent to 8.7 per cent of the Swedish savings market. Avanza is the largest Swedish player in terms of number of transactions and turnover on the Stockholm Stock Exchange, including First North. During the last 16 years Avanza has won SKI’s (Swedish Quality Index) award, “Year’s Most Satisfied Savings Customers”. For more information visit: "]},{"type":"i","children":["avanza.se/ir"]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Attachments"]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://storage.mfn.se/9acfa038-d7f2-4bfd-b63b-13515552f639/august-monthly-statistics.pdf","linkText":"August: Monthly statistics*"}}]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"MFN by Modular Finance","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"modular_finance"}]},{"title":"Strategy, business, and products","args":[{"id":"section","value":"strategy_business_products"}]},{"title":"Swedish stocks","args":[{"id":"category","value":"stock"},{"id":"market_country","value":"SE"}]}],"id":"modular_finance:634e8623a5792:0","title":"August: Monthly statistics*","published":1788417000,"urgency":2,"relatedSymbols":[{"symbol":"OMXSTO:AZA","logoid":"avanza-bank-ab","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"avanza-bank-ab"}}],"storyPath":"/news/modular_finance:634e8623a5792:0-august-monthly-statistics/","read_time":129,"provider":{"id":"modular_finance","name":"MFN by Modular Finance","logo_id":"rdp-mfn"}}